# The image is built from package*.json, tsconfig*.json, src/ and config/ only. Everything else is
# either not shipped (harness scripts, docs, CI) or must never be near a build context (PHI,
# databases). config/ holds the shipped defaults, which are part of the product (yourphr#621) —
# the process refuses to boot without them.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src/
!config/
